<title>CANADA: Poco says wins 95 pct of Gardiner.</title>
<headline>Poco says wins 95 pct of Gardiner.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poco Petroleums Ltd said on Thursday it took up more than 95 percent of the issued and outstanding shares of Gardiner Oil and Gas Ltd under its takeover offer for Gardiner made September 17.</p>
<p>Poco said it planned to take the rest of the company private under the compulsory acquisition provisions of the Business Corporations Act.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
